# Patterns start with **/ so they match in subfolders too (a bare name only matches at the context root).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.eslintcache
**/.vite
**/.git
**/.env*
# Course build output must never end up in the frontend image.
**/build
**/private
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
